WEBVTT

00:00:25.670 --> 00:00:28.970
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:30.810 --> 00:00:34.210
Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!! Guts!! Gobble!!

00:00:36.410 --> 00:00:39.050
Calling everything delicious!

00:00:39.050 --> 00:00:43.550
The more I eat, the more powerful I get!

00:00:44.120 --> 00:00:46.920
Let’s capture ingredients around the world!

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.500
I dream of being an invincible 
Gourmet Fighter!!

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:56.530
Now on to the bottom of the 
sea, or the tops of glaciers!

00:00:56.530 --> 00:00:59.200
Jump! Jump Jump Jump! 
Knock! Knock Knock Knock!

00:00:59.200 --> 00:01:01.400
Give thanks!

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:04.610
Let’s eat!

00:01:05.040 --> 00:01:10.410
Wow wo!! Spiked Punch! Wow wo!! Multi-fold!

00:01:10.410 --> 00:01:15.550
Guts! Gutsy Guts! I can eat any dream!

00:01:15.550 --> 00:01:20.820
Wow wo!! My very own... 
Wow wo!! ...Full Course!

00:01:21.090 --> 00:01:24.990
Guts! Gutsy Guts! Gather them all up!

00:01:24.990 --> 00:01:31.070
And put the world on my plate!

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:33.870
Wow wow wow! Eat the mountains!!

00:01:33.870 --> 00:01:36.440
Wow wow wow! Toriko!!

00:01:36.440 --> 00:01:39.040
Wow wow wow! Eat the oceans!!

00:01:39.040 --> 00:01:43.310
Wow wow wow! Tori, Tori, Tori, Toriko!!

00:01:46.610 --> 00:01:49.020
Someone once said:

00:01:49.380 --> 00:01:55.090
There are juicy spare ribs 
with spongy lobster meat,

00:01:55.090 --> 00:01:57.390
giving out a delicious scent when grilled...

00:01:57.390 --> 00:02:00.930
The Spareribster!

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:06.470
There are forests in which 
sprout eringi mushrooms

00:02:06.470 --> 00:02:10.070
the flavor of creamy, 
springy, rich pudding...

00:02:10.070 --> 00:02:14.340
The Pudingi!

00:02:15.040 --> 00:02:18.110
The world is in the Gourmet Age!

00:02:18.110 --> 00:02:22.750
An age in which people quest for 
yet unknown culinary delights!

00:02:25.020 --> 00:02:28.020
This is Ice Mountain, in 
which sleeps the Century Soup

00:02:28.020 --> 00:02:30.520
that only appears once every hundred years.

00:02:30.620 --> 00:02:34.190
A battled unfolded with the 
Gourmet Corp. over the soup!

00:02:34.190 --> 00:02:38.770
Toriko managed to beat back Tommyrod, 
but he collapsed, out of energy.

00:02:39.170 --> 00:02:41.300
Toriko was nearly finished!

00:02:41.300 --> 00:02:44.840
But he was saved by the Gourmet 
Reviver Teppei, who came rushing in!

00:02:45.810 --> 00:02:48.210
Tommy squeezed out his last bit of power

00:02:48.210 --> 00:02:52.550
to give birth to the ultimate Amalgam 
Beast, the Parasite Emperor!

00:02:53.650 --> 00:02:58.650
At the same time, the reborn ruler 
of Ice Hell, Hellboros, showed up!

00:02:59.150 --> 00:03:01.850
The two monsters began to fight!

00:03:02.620 --> 00:03:08.860
Around then, Komatsu had the last bit of 
Century Soup stolen by a miniature GT Robot.

00:03:09.460 --> 00:03:11.960
Then, thanks to Teppei's first-aid,

00:03:11.960 --> 00:03:16.100
Toriko and the others' lives were saved, 
and they headed to Komatsu's location.

00:03:18.070 --> 00:03:23.510
The Last Drop! Who Will 
Get the Century Soup?!

00:03:30.580 --> 00:03:33.020
Sorry to keep you waiting, Komatsu.

00:03:34.190 --> 00:03:35.450
Toriko-san...

00:04:03.110 --> 00:04:08.390
Even though everyone almost 
gave their lives for it...

00:04:10.490 --> 00:04:12.420
And I'd finally found it...

00:04:13.220 --> 00:04:16.990
The last bit of Century Soup...

00:04:18.290 --> 00:04:20.460
It was taken by a GT Robot...

00:04:23.870 --> 00:04:25.800
...riding on a fly...

00:04:27.840 --> 00:04:30.510
A miniature GT Robot?

00:04:30.940 --> 00:04:32.610
I don't really know...

00:04:35.540 --> 00:04:37.050
It was over in an instant.

00:04:37.410 --> 00:04:43.250
I'm sorry... I'm so sorry...

00:04:43.750 --> 00:04:44.890
Komatsu...

00:04:45.650 --> 00:04:48.420
When aiming for getting ingredients 
from the great wilds of nature,

00:04:48.420 --> 00:04:50.090
ending in failure...

00:04:50.990 --> 00:04:53.030
It happens all the time!

00:04:53.460 --> 00:04:57.230
Even for pro Gourmet Hunters 
like me, it's pretty common.

00:04:57.230 --> 00:04:59.130
This isn't something to be embarrassed about.

00:04:59.470 --> 00:05:03.000
Frankly, I'm glad you're still alive.

00:05:03.000 --> 00:05:06.740
As long as you're alive, 
you'll get another chance!

00:05:08.980 --> 00:05:12.780
Toriko-san!

00:05:14.180 --> 00:05:16.920
Toriko-san, Toriko-san...

00:05:17.220 --> 00:05:19.420
Toriko-san!

00:05:19.420 --> 00:05:22.690
Did the Gourmet Corp. really get the soup?

00:05:23.420 --> 00:05:25.490
Hey, Teppei.

00:05:25.860 --> 00:05:27.460
The request this time

00:05:27.460 --> 00:05:32.200
comes straight from that living National 
Gourmet Treasure, Granny Setsu.

00:05:32.200 --> 00:05:34.540
Failure will not be tolerated.

00:05:34.540 --> 00:05:38.370
Master, please don't put 
that kind of pressure on me!

00:05:38.370 --> 00:05:44.310
Also, Toriko's on the scene, 
so watch yourself out there.

00:05:44.310 --> 00:05:46.410
Toriko's one of the Four Heavenly Kings!

00:05:46.410 --> 00:05:48.920
There's no reason for me to go, is there?

00:05:48.920 --> 00:05:52.190
The rest is just my intuition, Teppei...

00:05:52.190 --> 00:05:55.490
But I think the Gourmet Show 
Window might be finished already.

00:05:55.920 --> 00:05:58.660
Please, don't say something like that!

00:05:58.660 --> 00:06:01.290
Your intuition is usually spot on, Master!

00:06:03.630 --> 00:06:07.370
If by some chance the Show 
Window really is dead,

00:06:07.370 --> 00:06:12.670
the last drop will follow the 
will of the Century Soup.

00:06:13.570 --> 00:06:16.710
The will of... the soup?

00:06:20.710 --> 00:06:24.350
The life on this continent is rotting...

00:06:27.650 --> 00:06:30.860
And then there is life 
that managed to survive...

00:06:30.860 --> 00:06:32.320
Are you okay?

00:06:33.090 --> 00:06:36.160
The price I pay for coming up 
with a great new move, I suppose.

00:06:36.160 --> 00:06:38.600
A great new move? What is it?

00:06:37.300 --> 00:06:39.130
Is it really true that the soup

00:06:38.600 --> 00:06:43.100
I call it the Leg Knife, and Leg Fork!

00:06:39.130 --> 00:06:40.870
would choose the Gourmet Corp.

00:06:40.870 --> 00:06:42.770
for its last drop?

00:06:43.370 --> 00:06:45.770
Answer me, Century Soup.

00:06:47.570 --> 00:06:49.170
Huh? What now?

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:54.780
Hey, is that...

00:06:55.150 --> 00:06:57.850
Those monsters are still 
going at it up above.

00:06:57.850 --> 00:06:59.420
M-Monsters?

00:07:05.020 --> 00:07:07.830
Whether or not we get any soup,

00:07:07.830 --> 00:07:12.060
there's still no guarantee we'll 
be able to come back alive.

00:07:40.390 --> 00:07:44.490
I came to pick you up because 
you were late, and this is why?

00:07:44.790 --> 00:07:45.830
Yes...

00:07:45.830 --> 00:07:48.460
Teppei showing up was not 
part of our calculations.

00:07:48.730 --> 00:07:52.370
Furthermore, the difficulty in 
operating this miniature GT Robot,

00:07:52.370 --> 00:07:53.770
and its lack of power...

00:07:54.040 --> 00:07:57.840
I wasn't even able to kill a single 
human... It was quite a shock.

00:07:57.840 --> 00:08:00.280
That's something beyond your control.

00:08:00.280 --> 00:08:00.980
In fact,

00:08:01.310 --> 00:08:05.050
just being able to operate the miniature 
version is an accomplishment, Yuu.

00:08:05.480 --> 00:08:09.150
Anyway, you've done well, obtaining the soup.

00:08:09.520 --> 00:08:12.490
I am unworthy of such praise, Al-sama.

00:08:12.890 --> 00:08:14.660
You've done enough.

00:08:14.660 --> 00:08:18.390
I will bring the robot back, 
so please head into my cape.

00:08:18.390 --> 00:08:20.730
Yes, thank you.

00:08:24.800 --> 00:08:27.700
However, they are quite loud.

00:08:34.740 --> 00:08:37.040
Throwing Plates!

00:08:47.350 --> 00:08:50.160
As expected from Alfaro-sama, 
the Gourmet Corp.'s garçon,

00:08:50.160 --> 00:08:53.230
and right-hand man to the Boss.

00:08:53.230 --> 00:08:56.700
To be able to defeat those 
two beasts just like that...

00:08:59.700 --> 00:09:02.340
It looks like those two were inside of it...

00:09:16.180 --> 00:09:17.880
A-Alfaro-sama!

00:09:17.880 --> 00:09:20.150
Just look at yourselves... Pitiful.

00:09:20.150 --> 00:09:22.050
W-We apologize!

00:09:22.420 --> 00:09:25.720
Now then... Where is Tommy?

00:09:27.260 --> 00:09:29.400
The cries have stopped...

00:09:30.460 --> 00:09:32.000
I wonder what happened?

00:09:35.530 --> 00:09:36.570
Takimaru!

00:09:36.570 --> 00:09:37.840
Takimaru-san!

00:09:39.770 --> 00:09:41.640
W-Where's the soup?

00:09:43.680 --> 00:09:45.540
I-I'm sorry...

00:09:47.280 --> 00:09:48.550
I see.

00:09:49.350 --> 00:09:55.050
The last drop will follow the 
will of the Century Soup.

00:09:57.790 --> 00:10:01.230
I have to make sure... as a Gourmet Reviver.

00:10:02.490 --> 00:10:05.860
I have to make sure... 
of the ingredient's end.

00:10:06.560 --> 00:10:08.000
What's that?

00:10:08.000 --> 00:10:09.600
Dormancy Extract.

00:10:10.170 --> 00:10:12.770
It will halt the function of plants.

00:10:22.180 --> 00:10:25.480
Everyone! This glacier will collapse shortly!

00:10:25.480 --> 00:10:29.090
But before that, I'm going to squeeze 
the last drop out of the Show Window!

00:10:29.090 --> 00:10:34.190
If we're lucky, we might get a few 
last drops of the soup to come out!

00:10:34.520 --> 00:10:35.730
Really?

00:10:37.330 --> 00:10:40.230
Pray! And behold!

00:10:40.230 --> 00:10:44.030
This is the last moment of 
the Gourmet Show Window!

00:11:32.110 --> 00:11:36.180
Fare thee well, Gourmet Show Window!

00:12:21.930 --> 00:12:23.800
I-It came out!

00:12:24.860 --> 00:12:28.700
Century Soup!

00:12:41.510 --> 00:12:44.020
The Century Soup actually came out!

00:12:44.420 --> 00:12:46.020
Teppei-san!

00:12:46.020 --> 00:12:49.490
It's the soup! The soup came out!

00:12:49.490 --> 00:12:50.490
Don't move!

00:12:51.620 --> 00:12:53.590
Everyone, stay right where you are.

00:12:54.860 --> 00:12:59.400
The final drop will follow 
the will of the Century Soup.

00:13:01.530 --> 00:13:06.910
All that's left is a single drop... If 
it comes to you, catch it with care!

00:13:44.740 --> 00:13:47.140
Century Soup!

00:13:55.520 --> 00:13:58.320
Thank you, Gourmet Show Window.

00:13:58.990 --> 00:14:04.090
Thank you for the miracle taste of the 
Century Soup these hundreds of years...

00:14:06.130 --> 00:14:08.400
Rest in peace.

00:14:16.140 --> 00:14:19.510
This is the Century Soup!

00:14:26.950 --> 00:14:31.720
This smell is making each nerve... 
each cell in my body react!

00:14:31.720 --> 00:14:34.920
Smelling it this close is so amazing!

00:14:34.920 --> 00:14:40.730
This aroma that whets my appetite... 
That directly calls upon my instincts...

00:14:41.600 --> 00:14:42.960
I want it!

00:14:42.960 --> 00:14:44.800
Let me have it!

00:14:48.340 --> 00:14:50.870
Stay calm now, you two.

00:14:51.370 --> 00:14:54.440
We can't decide who will drink the last drop

00:14:54.440 --> 00:14:57.480
when you two have lost your senses, can we?

00:14:57.950 --> 00:14:59.750
Will it be Toriko, one of 
the Four Heavenly Kings?

00:15:00.280 --> 00:15:01.820
The Gourmet Knight?

00:15:02.080 --> 00:15:03.280
The Mafia?

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:04.950
The TV Personality?

00:15:04.950 --> 00:15:06.420
M-Me?

00:15:06.420 --> 00:15:07.560
Or me?

00:15:07.560 --> 00:15:08.960
You're included, too?

00:15:08.960 --> 00:15:10.930
Or maybe the penguin or the pigeon?

00:15:10.930 --> 00:15:12.530
I don't think that'd be a good idea.

00:15:15.130 --> 00:15:18.330
Zonge-sama says "I'm here, too!"

00:15:18.330 --> 00:15:20.430
And so are the two of us!

00:15:20.730 --> 00:15:23.740
They still haven't left yet?

00:15:23.740 --> 00:15:25.770
I totally forgot about them.

00:15:26.940 --> 00:15:30.180
Of course... I'll pass.

00:15:30.180 --> 00:15:31.280
Takimaru!

00:15:31.610 --> 00:15:36.580
I can't go asking you to 
let me have the last drop.

00:15:37.020 --> 00:15:40.450
My stomach is full just 
knowing I'm still alive.

00:15:40.450 --> 00:15:44.020
My goal isn't to drink it myself.

00:15:44.290 --> 00:15:48.460
And what good would bringing 
back such a tiny amount do?

00:15:48.460 --> 00:15:52.160
A-As long as I get a scoop, I...

00:15:53.500 --> 00:15:55.270
I don't need any...

00:15:56.300 --> 00:15:58.440
Not even one gram!

00:15:58.440 --> 00:16:00.210
No need to force yourself.

00:16:00.210 --> 00:16:02.440
And you haven't gotten a scoop, you know.

00:16:04.180 --> 00:16:06.580
M-Me...

00:16:06.580 --> 00:16:08.380
Let me drink the soup!

00:16:10.320 --> 00:16:12.680
Please, Toriko-san!

00:16:19.790 --> 00:16:22.430
Nope. I'll drink it.

00:16:23.130 --> 00:16:25.000
T-Toriko-san?

00:16:25.700 --> 00:16:29.300
But a little drop like this isn't enough.

00:16:29.300 --> 00:16:31.140
I want to drink until my belly is full!

00:16:31.140 --> 00:16:35.410
So, the soup I drink... You make it, Komatsu!

00:16:35.870 --> 00:16:40.040
You're going to drink that now, and 
make sure to remember the taste.

00:16:42.010 --> 00:16:43.480
Toriko-san!

00:16:43.850 --> 00:16:45.780
Okay with you, Teppei?

00:16:48.320 --> 00:16:52.390
They say the mouth is the gate of 
misfortune, but here I will say clearly...

00:16:52.760 --> 00:16:54.120
I fully agree.

00:16:54.120 --> 00:16:56.660
How would those words cause misfortune?

00:16:57.060 --> 00:16:59.630
The answer was clear from the start.

00:16:59.630 --> 00:17:01.970
The soup fell to Komatsu-kun.

00:17:02.400 --> 00:17:07.740
We didn't choose Komatsu-kun. 
The soup chose Komatsu-kun.

00:17:08.100 --> 00:17:10.010
As its final customer.

00:17:10.010 --> 00:17:12.580
I-I won't be the last!

00:17:12.580 --> 00:17:14.680
I won't let it be!

00:17:14.680 --> 00:17:16.750
I will create it, you'll see!

00:17:16.750 --> 00:17:18.480
I'll make the Century Soup!

00:17:22.050 --> 00:17:24.050
T-This is...

00:17:26.890 --> 00:17:29.730
This isn't the end of an 
ingredient, it's the beginning!

00:17:29.730 --> 00:17:31.760
The beginning of a new Century Soup!

00:17:34.360 --> 00:17:39.770
I give thanks for all of 
this world's bounty...

00:17:57.820 --> 00:17:58.790
Komatsu?

00:17:58.790 --> 00:17:59.820
Komatsu-kun?

00:18:06.460 --> 00:18:08.930
W-What's with the face?

00:18:13.070 --> 00:18:14.600
What's wrong, Komatsu?

00:18:14.600 --> 00:18:16.900
Come back to us, Komatsu-kun!

00:18:18.970 --> 00:18:22.440
I-I'm sorry... I made a really 
shameful face there...

00:18:22.440 --> 00:18:24.580
You were smiling from ear to ear.

00:18:24.580 --> 00:18:26.710
So, how did it taste?

00:18:30.150 --> 00:18:32.150
Seriously, what's with the face?

00:18:32.150 --> 00:18:34.990
I sure hope you remember the taste...

00:18:34.990 --> 00:18:37.360
Toriko-san...

00:18:37.360 --> 00:18:43.130
I couldn't forget this delicious 
soup even if I tried to!

00:18:43.130 --> 00:18:46.070
Man, I wanted to taste it!

00:18:46.070 --> 00:18:49.940
Crap, I didn't film even a gram!

00:18:52.140 --> 00:18:54.670
Uh-oh... Better hurry.

00:18:54.670 --> 00:18:56.580
The Ice Mountain itself will shortly...

00:18:57.980 --> 00:18:58.950
What is it?

00:18:59.610 --> 00:19:01.050
I sense someone...

00:19:01.310 --> 00:19:04.550
Not a beast. Someone far stronger!

00:19:04.880 --> 00:19:08.420
Someone of extreme skill is very near!

00:19:20.030 --> 00:19:23.040
To push Tommy this far...

00:19:23.900 --> 00:19:29.710
Destroying Starjun's GT Robot, 
and even impressing Grinpatch...

00:19:30.540 --> 00:19:33.180
If we don't eliminate him now,

00:19:33.180 --> 00:19:36.820
it won't be long before he 
becomes a serious issue for us.

00:19:37.180 --> 00:19:38.280
Toriko...

00:19:39.420 --> 00:19:45.560
Damn, this isn't good... This 
guy's more powerful than Tommy.

00:19:45.560 --> 00:19:46.620
No way!

00:19:46.620 --> 00:19:51.960
If there were a lot of the soup, I 
could restore my energy and fight...

00:19:51.960 --> 00:19:55.600
Well, I wouldn't expect to 
win with this arm anyway...

00:19:55.600 --> 00:19:58.500
For now, all we can do is run.

00:19:59.170 --> 00:20:02.010
Toriko-san, leave me behind...

00:20:02.370 --> 00:20:05.080
I'll just slow you down.

00:20:05.080 --> 00:20:06.610
Takimaru, what are you...

00:20:06.610 --> 00:20:08.110
What are you saying?

00:20:08.350 --> 00:20:10.980
You just had your life saved!

00:20:10.980 --> 00:20:16.590
You can drink all the Century Soup you 
want when I make it, Takimaru-san!

00:20:16.590 --> 00:20:18.590
So let's all get out of here, together!

00:20:19.360 --> 00:20:20.590
Komatsu-kun...

00:20:20.990 --> 00:20:24.360
Sure, but I sense this 
dangerous guy up above.

00:20:24.360 --> 00:20:27.330
That means we can't get out of this glacier.

00:20:27.330 --> 00:20:29.970
Unless we find some other exit...

00:20:31.370 --> 00:20:32.340
Hey!

00:20:32.340 --> 00:20:35.300
Zonge-sama said he'll tell 
you if you de-Knock him!

00:20:35.300 --> 00:20:38.610
He'll show you a nice way back!

00:20:38.610 --> 00:20:39.340
What?

00:20:39.340 --> 00:20:40.340
Seriously?

00:20:42.180 --> 00:20:45.980
He said: "Who the hell do you think I am?"

00:20:45.980 --> 00:20:47.120
Yeah, who is he?

00:20:47.120 --> 00:20:49.620
I'm pretty sure it was... Bongo-san?

00:20:49.620 --> 00:20:52.720
Anyway, we'll have him lead us to this exit.

00:20:52.720 --> 00:20:55.090
Because if we don't get out of here quick,

00:20:55.090 --> 00:20:59.860
we're going to have another 
crazy powerful guy show up.

00:21:00.560 --> 00:21:03.830
I won't let a single one of them escape.

00:21:05.830 --> 00:21:08.170
Hold it there!

00:21:09.040 --> 00:21:13.740
You youngsters aren't getting any further!

00:21:16.810 --> 00:21:18.010
Setsuna...

00:21:23.380 --> 00:21:27.590
I'm grumble-grumble hungry! 
My tummy's rumble rumblin'!

00:21:28.690 --> 00:21:31.860
Today we're out there: Ack 
SOS, I'm in trouble yes!

00:21:31.860 --> 00:21:35.230
Gotta go! Gotta go! Can't 
leave this alone, right?

00:21:35.500 --> 00:21:38.700
Giving you support and cheer, 
the duties are endless!

00:21:38.700 --> 00:21:42.070
Burnin' up! Bustin' out! Trouble buster!

00:21:42.070 --> 00:21:45.110
Oh my god! A heaping helping of energy!

00:21:45.110 --> 00:21:48.910
When I'm hungry I can't get any power!

00:21:48.910 --> 00:21:52.450
Go, fight! At attention to you!

00:21:52.450 --> 00:21:55.620
Two-way communication!

00:21:55.620 --> 00:21:59.120
The encouragement I get 
from you is my nourishment!

00:21:59.390 --> 00:22:02.860
I want to eat lots of delicious things!

00:22:02.860 --> 00:22:06.230
Our future looks to be tasty!

00:22:06.230 --> 00:22:08.090
Right? OK. Left? OK.

00:22:08.090 --> 00:22:12.800
Be careful, courageously! Right on, let's go!

00:22:12.800 --> 00:22:16.370
Fight with bravery!

00:22:16.370 --> 00:22:20.070
Deli-deli delicious, and let's eat!

00:22:24.610 --> 00:22:26.610
Gourmet News!

00:22:27.610 --> 00:22:29.280
I'm your host, Tina!

00:22:29.280 --> 00:22:35.490
A ton of rare and precious ingredients 
slept within the Gourmet Show Window...

00:22:35.490 --> 00:22:37.090
Speaking of "rare"...

00:22:37.090 --> 00:22:41.490
If you mix yogurt and tofu together...

00:22:44.660 --> 00:22:49.670
...it really tastes just 
like thick, rare cheesecake!

00:22:49.970 --> 00:22:50.840
What?

00:22:50.840 --> 00:22:52.140
You say the Gourmet Show Window

00:22:52.140 --> 00:22:54.770
doesn't have anything to 
do with rare cheesecake?

00:22:55.370 --> 00:22:58.780
They both are good to the last drop!

00:22:59.510 --> 00:23:01.450
Thanks, I'll be here each week.

00:23:02.310 --> 00:23:04.780
Now, on to the next story!

00:23:06.900 --> 00:23:09.250
We got the soup, but can’t make it home?

00:23:09.250 --> 00:23:11.090
But, the adventure doesn't end until you get home!

00:23:11.480 --> 00:23:13.760
...Wait, is that Granny Setsu!?

00:23:14.140 --> 00:23:16.960
Farewell, Ice Hell! Granny Setsu's Hidden Power!

00:23:17.580 --> 00:23:19.440
Look forward to another heaping helping of fun!
